sequenceDiagram
    participant HOOK as useIdentityVerification
    participant EMB as HostedWebView or HostedFrame
    participant PAGE as GET /hosted/:sessionId
    participant SDK as Provider web SDK

    HOOK->>EMB: render with session.url and session.allowedOrigin
    EMB->>PAGE: load
    PAGE->>PAGE: install window.__kycBridge
    PAGE->>SDK: init with the session access token

    SDK-->>PAGE: idCheck.onApplicantLoaded
    PAGE-->>EMB: kyc-bridge envelope - type applicantLoaded
    Note over PAGE,EMB: RN gets a JSON string via ReactNativeWebView.postMessage, web gets an object on window.parent with target origin star
    EMB->>HOOK: interpretBridgeMessage drops any other source or protocol version
    Note over EMB,HOOK: web additionally requires event.origin equals allowedOrigin and event.source equals the frame contentWindow

    SDK-->>PAGE: idCheck.onApplicantSubmitted
    PAGE-->>EMB: type submitted
    EMB->>HOOK: pending

    SDK-->>PAGE: access token expired
    PAGE-->>EMB: type tokenExpired
    HOOK->>HOOK: isTokenRefreshable(source)
    alt Refreshable
        HOOK->>HOOK: await source.refreshToken(session)
        alt React Native
            HOOK->>PAGE: injectJavaScript createSetTokenScript - bare token
        else Web
            HOOK->>PAGE: contentWindow.postMessage createSetTokenMessage - full envelope, targeted at allowedOrigin
        end
        alt Mock provider
            Note over PAGE: renderMockPage's setToken only writes a DOM acknowledgement (data-token-refreshed, a Token refreshed note) - no bridge event goes back to EMB or HOOK
        else Sumsub provider
            PAGE->>SDK: resume with the new token
        end
    else Not refreshable · no allowedOrigin · refresh rejected
        HOOK->>HOOK: error TOKEN_EXPIRED or TOKEN_REFRESH_FAILED - session kept, Restart offered
    end

    SDK-->>PAGE: idCheck.onApplicantStatusChanged
    PAGE-->>EMB: type complete with the normalized status
    EMB->>HOOK: onComplete
